This product includes software material derived from 3DCodeBench
(https://github.com/gaoypeng/3dcodebench). TreeStruct3D preserves the upstream
Blender generation system prompt for controlled research comparisons and adds
structure planning, structural validation, repair orchestration, and related
documentation.

This product also redistributes the 3DCodeBench evaluation split from
https://huggingface.co/datasets/YipengGao/3DCode. Its text and reference factory
